  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support Expert Grup</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d Expert Grup</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By the end of the intervention Expert Grup is expected to have a good understanding and apply in their work Environment and climate, gender equality perspectives and HRBA, also, in terms of organiastional development, Expert Grup will implement all the recommendations of the System Based Audit for improvement of their internal processes.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Civil Society Organisation Expert Grup. The support aims to strengthen the organization and contribute to their activities. The core support activities includes the five programs run by Expert Grup:
- Organization Development
- Financial and comunication
- DCFTA
- Sustainable development
- Methodology and research
- Public administration reform
- Monetary sector
- Financial sector
- Public sector
- Energy Sector</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till den Moldaviska civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationen Expert Grup. St&#xf6;det syftar till att st&#xe4;rka organisationen och bidra till deras verksamhet genom flexibel finansiering som kan anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r b&#xe5;de projekt och l&#xf6;pande kostnader f&#xf6;r verksamheten. K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;deverksamheten innefattar utvecklande och st&#xe4;rkande av Expert Grups fyra program: 
- Organization Development
- Financial and comunication
- DCFTA
- Sustainable development
- Methodology and research
- Public administration reform
- Monetary sector
- Financial sector
- Public sector
- Energy Sector</narrative>
  </description>
